      "message": "loko@, thanks. \n\nI think maybe doing a copy only in `MaybeError UnpackLimitsIn(const Limits* limits, CombinedLimits* out);` through here is enough ?\n\nBecause we still need NormalizeLimits and ReifyDefaultLimits (instead of using default value in \"dawn.json\") because of featureLevel. Unless we could have such table in dawn.json.",
